00:09:31,560 --> 00:09:32,320
Of course.

292
00:09:32,880 --> 00:09:34,320
From the first couple of days,

293
00:09:34,320 --> 00:09:34,960
I could tell you were always

294
00:09:34,960 --> 00:09:36,960
looking at me.

295
00:09:36,960 --> 00:09:37,880
And I could always feel like

296
00:09:37,880 --> 00:09:39,240
you were around

297
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:40,320
wherever I went.

298
00:09:40,320 --> 00:09:40,600
Yeah.

299
00:09:40,600 --> 00:09:41,040
So I thought

300
00:09:41,040 --> 00:09:42,400
maybe we were moving too fast.

301
00:09:42,400 --> 00:09:43,320
I was worried

302
00:09:43,880 --> 00:09:45,400
you'd get too cocky

303
00:09:45,400 --> 00:09:46,680
and think you got me too easily.

304
00:09:46,680 --> 00:09:47,200
Fair enough.

305
00:09:47,700 --> 00:09:48,280
Because on the first day,

306
00:09:48,280 --> 00:09:49,800
we didn't interact much.

307
00:09:49,800 --> 00:09:51,200
(Filmed while stationary)

308
00:09:51,200 --> 00:09:52,840
I was a little upset that day.

309
00:09:53,760 --> 00:09:55,480
Why was he acting so coy?

310
00:09:55,480 --> 00:09:56,160
(First day at Signal House)

311
00:09:56,160 --> 00:09:56,520
Um...

312
00:09:56,520 --> 00:09:57,190
What's going on?

313
00:09:57,190 --> 00:09:58,040
(The induction stove is still on)

314
00:09:58,040 --> 00:09:58,840
Why didn't you turn it off?

315
00:09:59,140 --> 00:09:59,620
It should...

316
00:09:59,620 --> 00:10:01,020
(Starting a conversation)
We're checking the temperature.

317
00:10:01,360 --> 00:10:02,280
I see.

318
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:09,240
What do you mean?

319
00:10:09,240 --> 00:10:09,860
(Being coy)

320
00:10:11,040 --> 00:10:11,860
Oh, my God.

321
00:10:12,080 --> 00:10:13,920
Why does everyone sound so lovey-dovey?

322
00:10:13,920 --> 00:10:15,440
What were they even saying?

323
00:10:15,440 --> 00:10:16,200
It doesn't matter.

324
00:10:16,200 --> 00:10:18,200
(Cupid Fiona Sit)
You just need to hear that voice.

325
00:10:18,200 --> 00:10:18,960
It doesn't matter.

326
00:10:18,960 --> 00:10:20,440
This is so sweet.

327
00:10:22,280 --> 00:10:24,240
(Filmed while stationary)
What do you mean?

328
00:10:24,240 --> 00:10:25,440
(Being coy)

329
00:10:25,440 --> 00:10:27,600
They've got heart eyes for each other.

330
00:10:31,320 --> 00:10:32,240
What about now?

331
00:10:32,240 --> 00:10:33,220
(Asking)

332
00:10:33,520 --> 00:10:35,360
Of course I'm happy now.

333
00:10:35,360 --> 00:10:36,720
So you won't think about the past.

334
00:10:36,720 --> 00:10:38,320
Definitely not anymore.

335
00:10:40,760 --> 00:10:42,880
Another kiss.

336
00:10:43,400 --> 00:10:44,360
Happy.

337
00:10:45,640 --> 00:10:48,320
You bit me again.

338
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:51,720
I have lip balm on.

339
00:10:59,520 --> 00:11:00,960
I'll wait for
when you're not wearing lip balm.

340
00:11:01,600 --> 00:11:02,400
What?

341
00:11:02,400 --> 00:11:03,320
Nothing.

342
00:11:05,200 --> 00:11:06,560
He's the one getting flustered.

343
00:11:06,560 --> 00:11:07,200
He's embarrassed.

344
00:11:07,480 --> 00:11:08,560
What are you two doing?

345
00:11:09,080 --> 00:11:10,040
Sami,

346
00:11:10,040 --> 00:11:11,360
when a guy says that

347
00:11:11,360 --> 00:11:13,480
and then gets flustered,

348
00:11:13,480 --> 00:11:14,400
how would you interpret it

349
00:11:14,400 --> 00:11:16,200
from a psychological perspective?

350
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:21,400
Physical attraction.

351
00:11:21,800 --> 00:11:23,720
Oh, physical attraction.

352
00:11:23,720 --> 00:11:25,720
Exactly.

353
00:11:28,980 --> 00:11:30,780
(After the heart-to-heart moment)

354
00:11:32,860 --> 00:11:34,140
(Sun Qimeng returns to Signal House)

355
00:11:34,160 --> 00:11:35,280
Meng.

356
00:11:39,360 --> 00:11:40,200
Anyone around?

357
00:11:43,400 --> 00:11:44,400
Meng.

358
00:11:44,400 --> 00:11:46,120
Yes.

359
00:11:46,120 --> 00:11:48,040
I need a strongman.

360
00:11:48,040 --> 00:11:49,640
Help me move some stuff. Come on.

361
00:11:50,160 --> 00:11:51,080
I can do it.

362
00:11:51,080 --> 00:11:52,040
I'm the strongman.

363
00:11:52,240 --> 00:11:53,280
Move some stuff?

364
00:11:56,480 --> 00:11:56,760
Hi, guys.

365
00:11:56,760 --> 00:11:57,640
Come help me.

366
00:11:58,240 --> 00:11:59,320
Help me move some stuff.

367
00:11:59,560 --> 00:12:00,160
Move what?

368
00:12:00,160 --> 00:12:02,040
The cart. Help me bring it up here.

369
00:12:02,040 --> 00:12:02,960
Bring the cart up here.

370
00:12:02,960 --> 00:12:04,080
See? My cart's over there.

371
00:12:04,680 --> 00:12:05,040
Okay.

372
00:12:05,040 --> 00:12:06,240
Let's go.

373
00:12:08,700 --> 00:12:09,780
(Setting things down)

374
00:12:09,800 --> 00:12:11,320
Who made it back?

375
00:12:11,320 --> 00:12:12,600
Just you.

376
00:12:13,160 --> 00:12:14,040
Just me?

377
00:12:14,040 --> 00:12:15,280
So hot, Sun Bohan.

378
00:12:18,200 --> 00:12:19,400
This is my cart.

379
00:12:19,400 --> 00:12:20,800
What's all this?

380
00:12:20,800 --> 00:12:22,080
That's the secret.

381
00:12:22,080 --> 00:12:22,640
A secret?

382
00:12:22,640 --> 00:12:23,960
Just help me.

383
00:12:23,960 --> 00:12:24,600
Is it heavy?

384
00:12:24,600 --> 00:12:25,320
Not really.

385
00:12:25,320 --> 00:12:26,520
Is it a little heavy?

386
00:12:26,880 --> 00:12:28,040
Let's do it together.

387
00:12:28,040 --> 00:12:29,360
I can do this.

388
00:12:29,360 --> 00:12:30,840
Is it really that light?

389
00:12:30,840 --> 00:12:31,240
Yeah.

390
00:12:31,240 --> 00:12:32,760
Let go. I've got it.

391
00:12:32,760 --> 00:12:34,240
You really can do it.

392
00:12:34,440 --> 00:12:36,800
I was wondering who left it there.

393
00:12:38,320 --> 00:12:39,800
He's reliable.

394
00:12:39,800 --> 00:12:41,260
I'm totally biased
when it comes to Sun Bohan now.

395
00:12:41,260 --> 00:12:42,160
I like everything about him.

396
00:12:42,280 --> 00:12:43,320
Nice.

397
00:12:43,320 --> 00:12:44,720
Thanks.

398
00:12:45,000 --> 00:12:45,840
You're just a little

399
00:12:45,840 --> 00:12:46,960
too handsome today.

400
00:12:46,960 --> 00:12:47,960
Me?

401
00:12:49,120 --> 00:12:51,240
Did you see Xing today?

402
00:12:51,240 --> 00:12:52,560
No, I didn't see her.

403
00:12:52,560 --> 00:12:54,440
Did you guys talk on the phone?

404
00:12:54,440 --> 00:12:55,760
Yeah, we called.

405
00:12:55,760 --> 00:12:57,360
A phone call.

406
00:12:57,680 --> 00:12:59,600
A happy phone call.

407
00:13:01,440 --> 00:13:03,040
Chen Hewen's back.

408
00:13:05,480 --> 00:13:06,640
He came back alone.

409
00:13:08,160 --> 00:13:08,760
Hi, guys.

410
00:13:08,760 --> 00:13:09,800
Hello.

411
00:13:09,800 --> 00:13:10,680
Everyone's dressed so formally.

412
00:13:10,680 --> 00:13:11,480
I'm not used to seeing this.

413
00:13:14,880 --> 00:13:15,800
You're the one who's dressed up.

414
00:13:15,800 --> 00:13:17,080
We just got back.

415
00:13:17,140 --> 00:13:18,740
(Zhao Xilun returns to Signal House)

416
00:13:18,740 --> 00:13:19,900
(Cui Yihang returns to Signal House)

417
00:13:19,940 --> 00:13:21,160
(Zhao Xilun)

418
00:13:21,160 --> 00:13:21,960
Zhao Xilun's back.

419
00:13:21,960 --> 00:13:23,160
He came back alone too.

420
00:13:23,760 --> 00:13:24,560
Hi, guys.

421
00:13:24,840 --> 00:13:26,160
Hello.

422
00:13:27,520 --> 00:13:28,680
Hello.

423
00:13:28,680 --> 00:13:30,240
Have a seat.

424
00:13:31,040 --> 00:13:32,160
Hello.

425
00:13:32,360 --> 00:13:33,520
Hello.

426
00:13:35,200 --> 00:13:36,560
Cui Yihang, that outfit looks great on you.

427
00:13:37,180 --> 00:13:38,540
(Smiles)

428
00:13:38,540 --> 00:13:39,960
(Cui Yihang)

429
00:13:39,960 --> 00:13:41,480
Neither of you saw her?

430
00:13:48,040 --> 00:13:48,840
No need to ask.

431
00:13:48,840 --> 00:13:49,800
We didn't come back together.

432
00:13:56,080 --> 00:13:57,160
Did you make a call today?

433
00:13:57,900 --> 00:13:58,640
I chose B (Keep Exploring).

434
00:14:06,240 --> 00:14:07,200
There's a butterfly here.

435
00:14:07,200 --> 00:14:08,000
I'll get it out of here.

436
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:09,100
Don't let it stay here.

437
00:14:09,100 --> 00:14:10,940
(Gets up)

438
00:14:12,360 --> 00:14:13,000
Hi.

439
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:13,720
Hi, Si.

440
00:14:13,720 --> 00:14:15,760
Hi, guys. You're back.

441
00:14:15,760 --> 00:14:17,240
Hi.

442
00:14:17,240 --> 00:14:18,480
Hi, Si.

443
00:14:18,480 --> 00:14:19,600
Hi.

444
00:14:19,600 --> 00:14:21,280
Why did everyone get back so early?

445
00:14:21,280 --> 00:14:22,360
You're pretty early too.

446
00:14:23,720 --> 00:14:24,920
So we're sitting over here?

447
00:14:24,920 --> 00:14:26,520
Come sit.

448
00:14:27,420 --> 00:14:28,820
(Glances)

449
00:14:29,180 --> 00:14:30,380
(Rubs hands)

450
00:14:30,940 --> 00:14:32,380
(Notices)

451
00:14:32,680 --> 00:14:33,520
I don't have a cushion here.

452
00:14:33,520 --> 00:14:35,280
I'm going to sit over there
so I can lean back.

453
00:14:35,280 --> 00:14:36,560
My lower back...

454
00:14:37,560 --> 00:14:39,120
I'll go over there too. My back hurts.

455
00:14:39,120 --> 00:14:40,060
(Follows)

456
00:14:43,640 --> 00:14:44,600
There's nothing
to lean against over there.

457
00:14:44,600 --> 00:14:45,920
Scoot over that way.

458
00:14:45,920 --> 00:14:47,160
Scoot over.

459
00:14:50,560 --> 00:14:51,720
(Getting closer)
So cute.

460
00:14:51,720 --> 00:14:52,680
Is your back okay?

461
00:14:52,680 --> 00:14:53,960
Why don't you squeeze in with us?

462
00:14:55,840 --> 00:14:57,550
(The wingmen are doing their job)
Good friends.

463
00:14:57,560 --> 00:14:58,720
(The wingmen are doing their job)
They're so cute.

464
00:15:06,600 --> 00:15:07,720
This one's Sun Bohan's.

465
00:15:07,720 --> 00:15:08,880
Xing got this for you.

466
00:15:08,880 --> 00:15:09,480
Yeah.

467
00:15:10,900 --> 00:15:11,860
(Smiles)

468
00:15:11,880 --> 00:15:13,320
Xing got these for you guys.

469
00:15:13,320 --> 00:15:14,240
Thanks.

470
00:15:16,000 --> 00:15:16,600
Why don't you keep it?

471
00:15:16,600 --> 00:15:17,960
You can look at it on the way.

472
00:15:17,960 --> 00:15:18,920
Okay.

473
00:15:19,600 --> 00:15:20,760
I'm not going.

474
00:15:23,400 --> 00:15:24,400
I want to stay here

475
00:15:24,400 --> 00:15:25,800
to take care of Xing.

476
00:15:26,720 --> 00:15:27,320
She probably

477
00:15:27,320 --> 00:15:28,600
wants you to go.

478
00:15:29,040 --> 00:15:30,480
But I don't want to go on the trip.

479
00:15:33,360 --> 00:15:35,040
I want to stay and take care of her.

480
00:15:35,040 --> 00:15:36,440
Keep her company.

481
00:15:36,440 --> 00:15:37,800
Don't worry. I've got it.

482
00:15:37,800 --> 00:15:39,120
That's nice.

483
00:15:47,280 --> 00:15:49,720
You guys can decide.

484
00:15:51,720 --> 00:15:52,280
Si,

485
00:15:52,280 --> 00:15:53,880
you two should go have fun.

486
00:15:53,880 --> 00:15:55,240
Don't worry about things here.

487
00:16:01,760 --> 00:16:02,960
Leave it to me.

488
00:16:02,960 --> 00:16:03,640
That's nice.

489
00:16:05,880 --> 00:16:06,800
It really feels like

490
00:16:06,800 --> 00:16:08,160
they're one big family.

491
00:16:14,700 --> 00:16:16,180
(Gets up)

492
00:16:19,920 --> 00:16:20,880
Where's Sha Yue'er?

493
00:16:29,060 --> 00:16:32,340
(Waiting)

494
00:16:38,320 --> 00:16:39,760
Whose badminton rackets are these?

495
00:16:39,760 --> 00:16:41,280
They have ribbons tied to them.

496
00:16:41,880 --> 00:16:43,080
Who brought them?

497
00:16:43,520 --> 00:16:44,880
What? Badminton rackets?

498
00:16:44,880 --> 00:16:45,440
Occupational hazard.

499
00:16:45,440 --> 00:16:47,080
The second he sees a badminton racket...

500
00:16:52,720 --> 00:16:53,680
What's over there?

501
00:16:56,040 --> 00:16:57,640
Let me tell you something.

502
00:16:57,640 --> 00:16:58,600
Let's go.

503
00:16:59,040 --> 00:16:59,840
Let me tell you.

504
00:17:00,480 --> 00:17:01,440
He drags her away.

505
00:17:01,920 --> 00:17:03,120
You brought it.

506
00:17:06,880 --> 00:17:08,120
You sure talk a lot.

507
00:17:08,120 --> 00:17:08,960
I'm sorry.

508
00:17:08,960 --> 00:17:10,200
I just happened to see them.

509
00:17:10,840 --> 00:17:12,000
It's really nothing.

510
00:17:12,000 --> 00:17:15,920
It's just the rackets.

511
00:17:15,920 --> 00:17:17,320
You said you like playing badminton.

512
00:17:19,540 --> 00:17:21,460
(Chen Hewen)

513
00:17:21,480 --> 00:17:23,280
It was supposed to be a surprise,

514
00:17:23,280 --> 00:17:24,760
but I saw it.

515
00:17:24,760 --> 00:17:26,120
We can go out for a bit.

516
00:17:26,320 --> 00:17:27,200
Let's go.

517
00:17:30,720 --> 00:17:32,360
When did you get back?

518
00:17:32,960 --> 00:17:33,480
Who?

519
00:17:33,480 --> 00:17:34,280
Hello.

520
00:17:34,280 --> 00:17:35,840
Hi.

521
00:17:35,840 --> 00:17:36,760
Sha Yue'er?

522
00:17:36,760 --> 00:17:38,240
Hi.

523
00:17:39,280 --> 00:17:40,640
Let's sit over there.

524
00:17:40,640 --> 00:17:41,280
Sure.

525
00:17:42,880 --> 00:17:44,000
Let me carry your bag.

526
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:45,000
Thanks.

527
00:17:47,440 --> 00:17:48,720
Over here?

528
00:17:49,880 --> 00:17:51,000
Hello.

529
00:17:54,280 --> 00:17:55,640
It looks wet.

530
00:17:57,360 --> 00:17:58,280
Yeah.

531
00:17:59,440 --> 00:18:01,000
We can stay here for a while.

532
00:18:01,920 --> 00:18:03,400
Did you wrap this yourself?

533
00:18:05,320 --> 00:18:06,240
Well...

534
00:18:07,480 --> 00:18:08,800
I had someone wrap it for me.

535
00:18:09,160 --> 00:18:10,200
You have great taste.

536
00:18:16,080 --> 00:18:17,480
Then I'll bring this with me.

537
00:18:17,480 --> 00:18:19,160
We can play there.

538
00:18:19,160 --> 00:18:21,280
Take it if you want.

539
00:18:21,280 --> 00:18:22,760
Then this is yours from now on.

540
00:18:24,240 --> 00:18:25,360
They have a future together.

541
00:18:25,920 --> 00:18:26,960
This one's mine.

542
00:18:26,960 --> 00:18:27,800
Okay.

543
00:18:33,240 --> 00:18:35,200
It's so wet. We can't sit here.

544
00:18:35,200 --> 00:18:35,720
Then let's go.

545
00:18:37,160 --> 00:18:38,120
I actually think that phone call

546
00:18:38,120 --> 00:18:39,320
brought them closer together.

547
00:18:39,320 --> 00:18:39,800
Yeah.

548
00:18:40,980 --> 00:18:44,620
(Sha Yue'er)

549
00:18:44,760 --> 00:18:45,560
Hi, everyone.

550
00:18:46,160 --> 00:18:47,080
Who came back?

551
00:18:47,080 --> 00:18:48,120
Sha Yue'er's accent.

552
00:18:48,120 --> 00:18:48,600
"Hi, everyone".

553
00:18:48,600 --> 00:18:49,320
Hello.

554
00:18:50,160 --> 00:18:51,000
Hello.

555
00:18:52,920 --> 00:18:54,000
(Moves closer)
Hello.

556
00:18:57,280 --> 00:18:58,120
Hello.

557
00:18:59,440 --> 00:19:00,120
Beautiful.

558
00:19:00,920 --> 00:19:01,880
So pretty.

559
00:19:02,530 --> 00:19:03,500
Beautiful.

560
00:19:05,080 --> 00:19:05,800
What's this?

561
00:19:06,080 --> 00:19:07,560
These are gifts I got for everyone.

562
00:19:07,760 --> 00:19:09,600
I'm heading home today.

563
00:19:10,680 --> 00:19:11,320
This...

564
00:19:25,340 --> 00:19:27,100
(Picking at his fingers)

565
00:19:28,760 --> 00:19:30,040
So you're leaving tonight?

566
00:19:31,240 --> 00:19:33,120
Yeah, I'll pack up in a bit
and head home.

567
00:19:33,120 --> 00:19:33,680
Really?

568
00:19:33,680 --> 00:19:35,320
So you're not sleeping with me tonight?

569
00:19:35,320 --> 00:19:35,600
It's okay.

570
00:19:35,600 --> 00:19:36,280
Once you get to Couples House,

571
00:19:36,280 --> 00:19:37,160
(Sun Qimeng)
you can, um...

572
00:19:37,160 --> 00:19:38,320
You will

573
00:19:38,720 --> 00:19:39,480
get lucky.

574
00:19:40,280 --> 00:19:41,640
Liang Xiaoyu must be really sad.

575
00:19:43,400 --> 00:19:44,800
Should I give you the gifts now?

576
00:19:44,800 --> 00:19:45,600
Sure.

577
00:19:47,280 --> 00:19:49,200
This is for you and Xing.

578
00:19:50,960 --> 00:19:52,880
It's magnetic.

579
00:19:53,160 --> 00:19:54,840
The two pieces stick together

580
00:19:54,840 --> 00:19:56,560
and become a star.

581
00:19:56,560 --> 00:19:57,680
It's called

582
00:19:57,680 --> 00:19:58,880
"Stars Attract".

583
00:20:01,000 --> 00:20:01,920
That's so thoughtful.

584
00:20:01,920 --> 00:20:02,760
It's really thoughtful.

585
00:20:03,440 --> 00:20:05,120
(Moved)
That's so thoughtful, Meng.

